{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNDER CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is a work in progress</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/bubbleintosteamburst.gif?t=1744897304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine Elements to Make Unique Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Fusion Mage, swap to a variety of spells on the fly by <strong>channeling elements</strong>. Acquire more elements for a deep well of strategic magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose the Right Spells for the Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some spells are more favorable in certain places. Different things react to your spells in unique ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/flameclawintofireball.gif?t=1744897304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful equipment is available at the shop, if you've got the gems. These items assist general and specific strategies alike. Trinkets give big upgrades, while potions can be used in a pinch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430730?t=1744897304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430730?t=1744897304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/070e24f09218e785f52b6452452f33bd05add84e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744897304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/070e24f09218e785f52b6452452f33bd05add84e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744897304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNDER CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is a work in progress</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/bubbleintosteamburst.gif?t=1744897304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine Elements to Make Unique Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Fusion Mage, swap to a variety of spells on the fly by <strong>channeling elements</strong>. Acquire more elements for a deep well of strategic magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose the Right Spells for the Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some spells are more favorable in certain places. Different things react to your spells in unique ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/flameclawintofireball.gif?t=1744897304\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful equipment is available at the shop, if you've got the gems. These items assist general and specific strategies alike. Trinkets give big upgrades, while potions can be used in a pinch.</p>","developers":["Plutoneus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/ac30fdaf86eb1175ab527389b6047acb9533a55c/header.jpg?t=1744897304","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}